    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Recipient claims a bucket to a merchant. FreeCash allows any merchant\\n(typically the recipient's own wallet, then a SEP-24 off-ramp); restricted\\nbuckets require the merchant to be whitelisted for that category.",
